  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Crown Of Thorns**: rare: 13 archived performances [2]\n- **My Rose Of Old Kentucky**: back after 225 archived shows (1540 days); rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Kentucky Girl**: back after 113 archived shows (643 days); rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Make Me A Pallet On Your Floor**: back after 82 archived shows (530 days); rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Kentucky Mandolin**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Crawdad Hole**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **Blues Stay Away From Me**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **These Memories Of You**: back after 140 archived shows (779 days); rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2024-04-26.mk4v.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 29 songs; 147 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Notes flag a Billy Strings solo clawhammer banjo section, a full band around one mic, and a solo a cappella spot front and center [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2024-04-26.mk4v.flac24**: taped by Brian Porter; source: Schoeps mk4v (FOB/DINa) > kcy > Sonosax SX-M2/LS2 > Sony M10 (24/48) [1]. Also: Transfer path: WAV, Sound Studio, xACT, then FLAC at 24/48 [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Rupp Arena 2-day Run Poster Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/rupp-arena-2-day-run-poster-regular/) [3]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Rupp Arena 2-day Run Poster Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/rupp-arena-2-day-run-poster-regular/) [4]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Rupp Arena KY Day 2 Poster Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/rupp-arena-ky-day-2-poster-regular/) [5]",
